      <li><strong>Brownville</strong> — 15 min east</li>
      <li><strong>LaGrange</strong> — 20 min north</li>
      <li><strong>Howland</strong> — 25 min south (Hazy Moose)</li>
      <li><strong>Bangor</strong> — 45 min south</li>
      <li><strong>Millinocket</strong> — 60 min northeast</li>
      <li><strong>Greenville / Moosehead Lake</strong> — 60 min north</li>
      <li><strong>Dexter</strong> (Puffers Place service area) — 30 min south</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

